docs {
  I am caught up (#1475): every open notification of level 2, Following, of the current member is marked as read, in every community or only in the community that `community` names (optional cuid). It never touches Needs you (level 0 and 1). It answers with the number of notifications that it marked (`data.marked`). With a session, it also forgets the date of the Catch up card (#1476). Needs notifications:write.
}
